<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx2.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="Sx2.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
